    "description": "Section 9A.9: a money_basis labelled net or gross must equal the terms.basis of the act it describes whenever that act's terms carries basis. Each case starts from vectors[base_vector]. act_terms_basis, when present, is set as the observed quote's act.terms.basis; when absent, the act states no basis. Placement \"act\" keeps only the quote's own money_basis and drops terminal_money_basis; placement \"terminal\" keeps only terminal_money_basis. The kept money_basis gets basis money_basis_basis. A valid case generates a record with record_hash that verifies. An invalid case is refused by the generator; the record generated with the label \"unspecified\" instead, then relabelled to money_basis_basis and resealed with producer_private_jwk, has resealed_record_hash and fails verification."
  },
